{"id":1196,"level":72,"name":"Усунення захисника: взяття","group":"Усунення захисника","format":27,"description":"<p>A defender is a piece that is protecting another piece. After removing this guard, one of the enemy pieces is no longer defended. That gives you a free capture. This tactic of <em>removing the defender</em> is also known as <em>undermining</em>. When your piece is taken after capturing the defender, it is called <em>trading</em>.</p>  <p>Always look at the position. Which of the enemy pieces are the most vulnerable? Vulnerable pieces have a weak defense. By luring away or removing the defender, you can attack the piece!&nbsp;</p>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Remove defenders by capture. Then, win material.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":61,"examples":[{"fen":"4rbk1/1B3ppp/8/p7/1n3P2/2B3P1/bR3N1P/6K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ya2][%cal Gb4a2]} 1. Bxb4 axb4 2. Rxa2 1-0","text":"<p>Чорний кінь — єдиний захисник слона. Давайте спершу знімемо це, щоб потім виграти матеріали!</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":41149,"fen":"1r1rb3/6kp/pqn1ppp1/8/1pP2P2/1P1RN1P1/PQ2P1BP/5RK1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ye3]} 1... Rxd3 2. exd3 Qxe3+ 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41197,"fen":"8/8/5pk1/R3n2p/P4p1P/5r2/6K1/7N w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yf3]} 1. Rxe5 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41203,"fen":"r1b2rk1/pp2pp1p/2n3p1/3Bb3/8/8/PPP2PPP/RNB1R1K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ye5]} 1. Bxc6 bxc6 2. Rxe5 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41208,"fen":"r4rk1/3p3R/p3pb2/2pb1pN1/8/1P1P4/5PPP/2B1R1K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yh7]} 1... Bxg5 2. Bxg5 Kxh7 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41892,"fen":"6k1/5pp1/3n3p/p2PpP2/P1p1P3/1r4P1/1NK1R2P/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yb3][%cal Gc4b3]} 1. Nxc4 {[%cal Gc4d6,Gc2b3]} Nxc4 2. Kxb3 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":4